# NOTE: git does NOT strip trailing inline comments. Keep every comment on its
# own line so patterns like "*.tfstate" match literally.

# ===== Terraform =====
# Provider/plugin cache (downloaded by `terraform init`)
.terraform/
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
# State can contain secrets, AWS account IDs, IPs, public keys — NEVER commit
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Real variable values (your public IP, key paths). Keep the *.example tracked.
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example

# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — commit it to pin providers.

# ===== Secrets / keys (defense in depth; real keys live in ~/.ssh, not here) =====
*.pem
*.key
munge.key
.env
*.env

# ===== Logs / job output =====
*.log
*-*.out

# ===== macOS / editors =====
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===== Local-only docs (not published) =====
CLAUDE.md
PROJECT_GUIDE.md
docs/interview-notes.md
